Modifications
-------------

Relative to that starting point, this repository has been reworked
substantially. The significant changes are:

  * Targeted at the nRF52832 (nRF52 DK, `nrf52dk/nrf52832`) instead of the
    nRF52840, with board-level devicetree and Kconfig files to match.
  * The buzzer is driven through the Zephyr PWM API (PWM1 channel 0, P0.12)
    rather than through a GPIO, so that the alarm rhythm is produced by a
    k_timer on top of the PWM output level.
  * The GATT service was extended: the RSSI characteristic (0x1526) and the
    ring-control characteristic (0x1528) were added, and the standard Battery
    Service (0x180F) replaced a custom battery characteristic.
  * The old application-layer password characteristic was removed. Access
    control now relies entirely on the link-layer pairing passkey through
    BT_GATT_PERM_WRITE_AUTHEN.
  * New modules were added: a moving-average RSSI filter, a distance grader
    with hysteresis, and the buzzer rhythm module.
  * A fixed boot self-test, an LED indication scheme and crash-forensics
    handlers were added.

A file-by-file history of these changes is kept in CHANGELOG.md, which is
deliberately not part of this repository.

